---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Donate to TibiaPlan - Support Free Tibia Tools"
  description="Support TibiaPlan to keep all tools free and ad-free. Every donation helps maintain and improve the site."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <article class="rounded-md border border-border-subtle bg-bg-surface p-8 sm:p-12">
      <header class="text-center">
        <h1 class="text-[24px] font-medium tracking-wide text-text-primary">
          Thank you for using TibiaPlan
        </h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-lg text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Every tool here is free, ad-free, and stays that way as long as we can.
          You don't have to donate anything to use the site — but if it's been
          useful to you and you want to help out, here's how.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-[180px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:items-start">
        <!--
          In-game screenshot of Mirra + the 25 TC minimum warning stacked.
          The image is cropped to a 180×180 square via object-cover.
        -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <img
            src="/donate/mirra.png"
            alt="Mirra in Tibia"
            width="180"
            height="180"
            class="mx-auto h-[180px] w-[180px] rounded-md border border-border-subtle bg-bg-sunken object-cover sm:mx-0"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <p
            class="rounded border border-gold/30 bg-gold/5 px-3 py-2 text-center text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-gold sm:max-w-[180px]"
          >
            <span aria-hidden="true">⚠</span>
            The 25 TC minimum isn't set by me — it's the smallest transfer
            the Tibia Store itself allows between accounts. Even just the
            minimum already helps a lot.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          <p>
            Feel free to send
            <span class="whitespace-nowrap font-semibold text-gold">25 Tibia Coins or more</span>
            to
            <span class="font-semibold text-accent-violet">Mirra</span>
            in-game. I'm thankful for every single coin — anything beyond
            the minimum is genuinely appreciated.
          </p>
          <p>
            Donations cover the domain (~$10/year) and any small future
            costs. Anything past that goes straight back into keeping the
            site fast, ad-free, and growing — new tools, sprite licensing,
            Spanish translation, all the things.
          </p>

          <div class="rounded-md border border-border-subtle bg-bg-sunken p-4 text-[12px]">
            <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-text-tertiary">
              How to send Tibia Coins
            </p>
            <ol class="mt-2 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-text-secondary">
              <li>Open the in-game store</li>
              <li>Go to <span class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Transfer Tibia Coins</span></li>
              <li>
                Recipient:
                <span class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Mirra</span> ·
                Amount:
                <span class="font-semibold text-text-primary">25 or more</span>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <p class="text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            From the bottom of my heart —
            <span class="font-semibold text-text-primary">thank you</span>.
            Whether you decide to donate or not, the fact that you're here,
            using the site and being part of this community, already means
            a lot to me.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 border-t border-border-subtle pt-6">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="rounded border border-border-subtle bg-bg-sunken px-4 py-2 text-[12px] text-text-secondary transition-colors hover:border-border-emphasis hover:text-text-primary"
        >
          ← Back to TibiaPlan
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://discord.gg/NfDrY5GM6y"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded px-4 py-2 text-[12px] font-medium text-white transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
          style="background:#5865F2"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="currentColor"
            class="h-3.5 w-3.5"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M20.317 4.37a19.791 19.791 0 0 0-4.885-1.515.074.074 0 0 0-.079.037c-.21.375-.444.864-.608 1.25a18.27 18.27 0 0 0-5.487 0 12.64 12.64 0 0 0-.617-1.25.077.077 0 0 0-.079-.037A19.736 19.736 0 0 0 3.677 4.37a.07.07 0 0 0-.032.027C.533 9.046-.32 13.58.099 18.057a.082.082 0 0 0 .031.057 19.9 19.9 0 0 0 5.993 3.03.078.078 0 0 0 .084-.028 14.09 14.09 0 0 0 1.226-1.994.076.076 0 0 0-.041-.106 13.107 13.107 0 0 1-1.872-.892.077.077 0 0 1-.008-.128 10.2 10.2 0 0 0 .372-.292.074.074 0 0 1 .077-.01c3.928 1.793 8.18 1.793 12.062 0a.074.074 0 0 1 .078.01c.12.098.246.198.373.292a.077.077 0 0 1-.006.127 12.299 12.299 0 0 1-1.873.892.077.077 0 0 0-.041.107c.36.698.772 1.362 1.225 1.993a.076.076 0 0 0 .084.028 19.839 19.839 0 0 0 6.002-3.03.077.077 0 0 0 .032-.054c.5-5.177-.838-9.674-3.549-13.66a.061.061 0 0 0-.031-.03zM8.02 15.33c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.956-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.176 1.096 2.157 2.42 0 1.333-.956 2.418-2.157 2.418zm7.975 0c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.955-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.176 1.096 2.157 2.42 0 1.333-.946 2.418-2.157 2.418Z" />
          </svg>
          Join the Discord
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
